\newlabel{fig:mobiwac:model}{{5}{63}{The single multi-task model. A check-in (semantic) window and a region (spatial) window pass through private encoders into the shared trunk, the only place where the two tasks interact. The category output uses the trunk's output alone; the region output combines it with a private spatial path. One model, one forward pass, two predictions}{figure.caption.33}{}}
